customer: attractive_guy
problem: screensaver
brief:
	A jock who doesn't care about computers, but his colleague at work has a cool screensaver, and he wants it too. The fix is the Pipes. No Cambion.

== drop-off
(neutral) Well hello there! I was hoping you could help me with kind of an urgent matter.
- Welcome to Compufun! I'll do my best to help. Tell me more.
- Urgent, huh? Haven't heard that in awhile.
(problem) You see, an attractive guy like me needs a matching screensaver.
- You want me to... change your screensaver..?
	(happy) Exactly! To something suiting my formidable person. I heard there's one with pipes or cables or whatever?
	- Sure! I know just the perfect one.
	- It's one of my most expensive services and I'm actually fully booked but for an extra fee I'll make an exception for you and let you skip the line.
	- What the actual...
	(happy) Excellent!
	(neutral) I'll be back to pick it up soon!

== pick-up
(neutral) Finally! I'm so excited to see my new screensaver!
- It was a tedious process but after thorough analysis I have managed to find the perfect fit.
- I truly hope it will meet your expectations.
- It was a tight game between the aquarium, the 3D pipes, the maze and the other "attractive" options...
(happy) Let me see it this instant!
- Behold! The most attractive screensaver there is!
- Here we go...
(happy) WOW! It's even better than I could've imagined! So cool! So futuristic! And formidable! Attractive!
